man domination number is 4 (achieved with two 2's), which also satisfies the condition.\\n\\n**Developing a counterexample search strategy**\\n\\nExploring cases where the radius equals 3, the Roman domination number might equal 3 or less to potentially violate the conjecture.  A Roman domination number of 1 is impossible due to the nature of Roman domination. If the Roman domination number is 2, the graph must have two vertices, and thus a radius of 1, invalidating this possibility.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"echo \\\\\\\"Waiting for task-25\\\\\\\"\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"1000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking command\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Wait a moment\\\"\"}}]}\n28: {\"step_index\":27,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"GENERIC\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-11T18:29:52Z\",\"content\":\"Created At: 2026-09-11T20:29:52+02:00\\nCompleted At: 2026-09-11T20:29:52+02:00\\n\\nThe command exited with code 0.\\nOutput:\\nWaiting for task-25\\r\\n\\n\"}\n29: {\"step_index\":28,\"source\":\"SYSTEM\",\"type\":\"SYSTEM_MESSAGE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-11T18:29:52Z\",\"content\":\"The following is a <SYSTEM_MESSAGE> not actually sent by the user. It is provided by the system as important information to pay attention to.\\n\\n<SYSTEM_MESSAGE>\\n[Message] timestamp=2026-09-11T18:29:49Z sender=7841936c-55c7-41c5-92b8-9773cb8ee932/task-25 priority=MESSAGE_PRIORITY_HIGH content=Task id \\\"7841936c-55c7-41c5-92b8-9773cb8ee932/task-25\\\" finished with result:\\n\\nThe command exited with code 0.\\nOutput:\\nLINT: ok\\r\\n/tmp/tmp.NhbFbKumF9.lean:17:8: warning: declaration uses `sorry`\\r\\n/tmp/tmp.NhbFbKumF9.lean:20:8: warning: declaration uses `sorry`\\r\\n'prove_e20263a9' depends on axioms: [propext, sorryAx, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\\r\\n'refute_e20263a9' depends on axioms